+# Seven-category call-site map
+
+Private exact registry owner-thread scope around normal _run preserves current callers; serialized requests carry only explicit descriptors; canonical request scope consumed once at live derive entry, historical _derive/_apply bypass pure. No source change outside ten files proposed.
+
+| Category | Original event | Frozen budget | Producer | Consumer | Lifetime |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| bootstrap | original worker task origin | original task/verification intersection | worker.py _execute and worker_runtime.__init__/_transition | check_active plus derive_bootstrap live transition gate | real startup until _execute finally |
+| capture | reserve_capture / reserve_supervision_capture / reserve_effect_capture enclosing effect; immutable returned RGBD identity | 5000000000 ns and original task/verification | worker_runtime reserve/complete camera methods | complete methods; cached observation lookup by exact payload hash | same startup owner; no reconstructed acquisition |
+| plan | original captured observation plus reserve_plan/reserve_supervision_plan through returned draft/reply | 5000000000 ns and original observation/task/verification/parent | worker_runtime reserve_plan/complete_plan and supervision plan | _transition/_supervision_transition and derive_bootstrap/derive_supervision live gates | same owner; reply/reobserve never refreshes acquisition |
+| grounding | original binding observation receipt and published binding immutable digest | original observation 5s plus task/verification/parent | worker_runtime publish_grounding/route | publication gate; current original observation/source | same owner; native/SafetyShield/action gates untouched |
+| supervision | reserve/complete capture, exact SupervisionContext and immutable frame/reply | original ordinary TTL bounded by 5s and task/verification | worker_runtime supervisor paths | supervision.decide_supervision; repository derive_supervision; classify_supervision_reply | same owner main thread; IO pending checks retain UTC/source guards |
+| marker | original registered actual frame acquisition and exact marker/camera/object context | 5000000000 ns and original task/verification | worker_runtime captured frame registry; marker_frame_context resolves reference | marker_association._associate live freshness; replay remains offline | private owner-thread scope around actual _run; copied/foreign context not authority |
+| condition | original registered actual frame acquisition and exact OnlineEvidenceSnapshot/ConditionSpec | max_age_s at most original 5s plus task/verification | worker_runtime frame registry; conditions resolves registered observation | evaluate_conditions/_evaluate; optional descriptive references; external UTC legacy unchanged | private owner-thread scope; public reference alone UNKNOWN |
