+Current R103 MD is `79dda0a8484c2258c2f2cf764cfc97434d9d4ffe72be6897303b89f43919a5c4`; JSON is `3eba2e3cef7a3f27adbdbb0a0ef4f6bf0f12f202068733c1a63f155f49c6c845`. Sol correctly stopped before implementation/validation; `R103/implementation/startup-stop.json` SHA `2671b61c1013384f35b29216b76970edd84ad3f7b2b68a01a2cbbb8d482cb16a` preserves expected/current hashes and scope discrepancy. ROOT old activation SHA `00a9a4cf835367c7c5b220d4a4e512830829907080ad155d3c595dad54155704` remains intact. Old plan hashes come from dispatch/stop/tool history; do not fabricate unavailable old plan bytes or an exact UTC ordering absent original command timestamps.
+
+Astra read the current full plan earlier, now independently rechecked current plans,14 input pins, ten current source/snapshot matches and both unused GREEN leaves. All match/absent as required. Source and budget are unchanged; no product proof/test/static/actual/Git was performed in this round.
+
+## Exact ROOT recovery
+
+1. Read current complete R103 MD/JSON, confirm all original codec/typed validity/live-owner/legacy-byte/32-case acceptance obligations remain; the current supported implementation is only operational_windows.py and tests/test_operational_windows.py. Adapter checks stay read-only. If satisfying all acceptance requires an adapter change, preserve the precise reason and seek a bounded plan; do not lower acceptance or silently revive old optional authority.
+2. Recheck the current two exact plan hashes and their MD cross-link,14 finite input pins, ten source/snapshot pins, final inherited budget, Sol startup-stop and absence of original GREEN directory/basetemp. Explicit type/key checks only; no product imports or tests. Existing R103 implementation directory contains startup-stop and is legitimate; do not require it absent or overwrite it.
+3. Save ONE new exclusive file `R104/root-replacement-activation.json`, containing actual review time, R104 two plan hashes, current R103 two full hashes, old activation path/hash, old plan hashes, startup-stop hash, checks and inherited budget. Declare `supersedes_activation` pointing to the unchanged old R103 activation and `old_activation_status=HISTORICAL_NOT_CURRENT_AUTHORITY`. This append-only record marks old authority superseded; never edit or rename the original activation. If the new filename exists, inspect and stop rather than overwrite it.
